@consumer = http://localhost:4135/odata/v4/shop

### Cross-provider expand: one local row, two remote providers
### `product` resolves against provider A, `warehouse` against provider B —
### one batched remote read per provider, then stitched.
GET {{consumer}}/InventoryReports?$expand=product,warehouse

### Expand only the product side (provider A)
GET {{consumer}}/InventoryReports?$expand=product

### Each remote entity is also directly queryable
GET {{consumer}}/Products
GET {{consumer}}/Warehouses
GET {{consumer}}/StockLevels
